            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='116' forceUpdate='true' h='6200' id='1276' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='98632' x='684' y='7450'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' underline='true'>Terminology</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>Subcategory</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'> refers to the category that is </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>1 level</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'> below the chosen category in the </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>Portfolio Level of Detail </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>filter. If the chosen category in the </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>Portfolio Level of Detail</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'> filter is </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Category 1</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>, </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>Vendor Brands Subcategories</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'> refers to the </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>number of Vendor Brand Category 2 in the corresponding Category 1</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>. If the Portfolio Level of Detail filter is Category 3, the columns on Subcategories will be blank, as the level after Category 3 would be at SKU level. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>* Refer to Definition tab for information on each metric. </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff2600' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>(WIP)</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone h='33650' id='1225' name='MTD Portfolio' w='98632' x='684' y='13650'>
              <layout-cache fixed-size-h='665' type-h='fixed' type-w='fixed' />
              <zone-style>
